, small- and medium-sized companies.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: left"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;(b) &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 3.84pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;This category includes equity securities of foreign companies, including those in developing countries.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 18pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: -18pt; text-align: left"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;(c) &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 4.4pt; text-indent: 0; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;This category includes investments in domestic corporate and/or government investment grade fixed-income instruments.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: left"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;(d) &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 3.84pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;This category includes investments in debt securities of foreign companies.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 18pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: -18pt; text-align: left"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;(e) &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 4.4pt; text-indent: 0; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;This category includes investments in pooled funds which can include both domestic and foreign equity securities and debt instruments.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: left"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;(f) &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 5.51pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;This category consists of cash and cash equivalents.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: 36pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;The following table presents the